<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "10000" "PASS"}
<TXSPN>I woke up to the blare of sirens.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it, this early..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time was 6:30.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? I'd fallen asleep on the living-room sofa...<PG>
There was a blanket over me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> must have gotten home late last night and thought to cover me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Another 30 minutes. I'll go back to sleep in my room...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\春花寝室.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Oh, I didn't charge my phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, and I haven't had my bath yet either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh! I didn't do my homework!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Homework, right from the day of the entrance ceremony...<PG>
Sadly, it looked like going back to sleep would have to wait.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned toward the desk to get the homework handout out of my bag.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">No way...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡茜紙人形.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡良治紙人形.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡なつみ紙人形.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Three sheets of paper had been left on the desk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These were paper dolls, no mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their surfaces were smeared with something like <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And there was writing on them...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Ryoji Kogori　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Akane Kogori　</STYLE>and, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>.<PG>
The strength drained from my body, and I sank to the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="どうき">heart</STYLE> pounded wildly, and my breathing quickened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's impossible...! I didn't do anything last night!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\春花寝室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Did the "witch" personality inside me make me do this...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there no escaping the curse on the anniversary of <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>'s death!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, why the Kogori family's names...<PG>
If there's anything I can think of, it's the cause of my <STYLE ID="8">dad</STYLE>'s death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, no! I don't hold a grudge over <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>, not at all! I don't hate them either!<PG>
No...! At this rate <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> will...! The life I finally got...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This would send me right back again! I absolutely have to stop the shinigami!<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">aa!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">You're finally up, so no going back to sleep!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>'s cheerful voice, first thing in the morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe the air in Motoki-cho suits her. She's livelier than she was in Megasawa.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh... yeah! I'm up! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're heading to Arata now, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\棚開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I hurriedly shoved the dolls into my desk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> found something like this, who knew what would happen...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"About that, a job came up that I just can't get out of. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I explained things to the Niimura main family, so Mom's going to work today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"O-oh, I see... Got it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So in the end, <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> wasn't going either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a job more important than the thirteenth-year memorial service... [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Also, they say there's no school today. I'll forward you the email too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"G-got it...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd never been this tense talking to <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
My phone rang. Probably the email <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> forwarded.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Subject: No School Today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Body:</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Good morning, everyone in Class 3-1! This is your homeroom teacher, Tanizaki!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">School is closed today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">For safety, the police says you should refrain from going outside, is what they sayed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I will post the details in detail on the homepage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Well then, everyone, have a nice holiday!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Tanizaki-sensei's Japanese is as weird as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And wishing us a nice holiday, of all things...
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "56" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never mind that. Right now, the question is what to do about this curse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The shinigami will come for the three of them, no doubt about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't undo this curse, and even if I could, I don't have time to look into how now.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I slammed my fist down on the desk as hard as I could.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A call? This early in the morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who could it be? It was from a number I didn't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes... hello?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, it's been a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That voice... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Geez, I was wondering who it was..."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... you didn't save my number?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nah, I just got a new phone, and the transfer didn't go right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, what's up?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... I heard neither of you is coming today?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Oh, yeah. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says a job came up out of nowhere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, I heard you weren't feeling well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I got food poisoning the day before yesterday. I'm taking a sick day today to be safe, but I'm fine now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hey... is </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> mad?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... don't worry. </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> seems to understand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... good, then... That all you wanted?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... well, yes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> was let down, that's all. Seemed to be looking forward to seeing you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">that one</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? Probably wanted to hassle me with more stupid dirty jokes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... heh. </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> adores you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Feels more like I'm a toy, though. So, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... the moment I called you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, Kana got called away by </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aw, bad timing."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, are you really feeling better? You don't sound very lively."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"R-really? Oh, no... see, I just woke up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... sorry, calling so early. I was a little worried."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, sorry you went to the trouble. Say hi to everyone for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, bye."</STYLE>
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And right then, my phone's battery died.<PG>
Maybe it was the ordinary conversation, but I felt I'd calmed down a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that alone doesn't solve anything. I have to come up with a plan against the shinigami.<PG>
If I think it over in the shower, I'll probably come up with a slightly better idea.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\蛇口.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シャワー.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\シャワー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
I braced both hands on the shower wall and let the hot water pour over my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Facing straight down so the water wouldn't get in my mouth, I breathed slowly and deeply through it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, think hard about what I can do right now!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a limit to what I can do alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If possible, with someone's help...<PG>
Someone who'd help me with something like this would be... Maybe I should talk to <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">She</STYLE> can read the room, so she probably won't flat-out deny the curse...<PG>
But even while I'm talking to her, I'll be worried about <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, what I can do is stay by <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>'s side the whole day, even if it's just today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the shinigami appears, I'll talk it into stopping.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I can stick with <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents too...<PG>
No, wait.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I'd be talking to <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE> about the curse in front of <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can never tell <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> something like this!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> right in front of me, and still able to talk with <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My head can't come up with a situation that convenient.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> might be laid up with April sickness today too.<PG>
In that case, how about spending the day at <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>'s place, the three of us with <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could talk to <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE> while <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> is resting...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But would the two of them act that conveniently...?<PG>
At times like this, how should I think it through?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay... at times like this, I'll think about what <STYLE ID="15">Goto</STYLE> would say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="15">she</STYLE> were in my position―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"Hmm, a situation where there's so much to do that you get confused..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
